{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":37112,\"title\":\"The Great Locomotive Chase\",\"tagline\":\"A true-life spy story of ultimate suspense. High speed and inconceivable bravery!\",\"overview\":\"During the Civil War, Union spy Andrews is assigned to lead a band of soldiers into the South in order to destroy the railway system. However, things don't go as planned when the conductor of the train they steal is on to them and is doing everything he can to stop them.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tbU8ECQEhWhMx3rEVaBulmId4s0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vNAvBHJCwp8KmXVYQ7zBQsDEksL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":37,\"year\":1956,\"runtime\":85,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Francis D. Lyon\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":29324,\"name\":\"Francis D. Lyon\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r8WWVNY6AQKC2cyzm8DH0Jsa0bp.jpg\"},{\"id\":50571,\"name\":\"Fess Parker\",\"character\":\"James J. Andrews\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z72Gh4aWood5nFj3S1iO3sTvAdR.jpg\"},{\"id\":30551,\"name\":\"Jeffrey Hunter\",\"character\":\"William A. Fuller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fWHskNEOlfgktpjhcacC2ri0RwO.jpg\"},{\"id\":34470,\"name\":\"Jeff York\",\"character\":\"William Campbell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oAhxdTKc3QbKLNvwAxztcOe00Bd.jpg\"},{\"id\":30844,\"name\":\"John Lupton\",\"character\":\"William Pittenger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xWN2nOktkUUwdKp2LIn6Hp24gr2.jpg\"},{\"id\":12423,\"name\":\"Eddie Firestone\",\"character\":\"Robert Buffum\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lRS5621TtzpuYa2av4AYrOhPrh7.jpg\"},{\"id\":103069,\"name\":\"Kenneth Tobey\",\"character\":\"Anthony Murphy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gCTbpGtA0UB4HkcqrkEUw5O094k.jpg\"},{\"id\":31208,\"name\":\"Don Megowan\",\"character\":\"Marion A. Ross\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3tVA3iTXNGvIuJnZMwkGzZsEyE.jpg\"},{\"id\":70036,\"name\":\"Claude Jarman Jr.\",\"character\":\"Jacob Parrott\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oPQCGgpWUjLgd7XpHKrMGYCjZFP.jpg\"},{\"id\":4316,\"name\":\"Harry Carey Jr.\",\"character\":\"William Bensinger\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7O61xbnqAMDOKVCh9ZH8deW6M30.jpg\"},{\"id\":191706,\"name\":\"Leonard P. Geer\",\"character\":\"J.A. Wilson\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Mk9B8VlFFHUHSfQ0SYagEMHboY.jpg\"},{\"id\":34131,\"name\":\"George Robotham\",\"character\":\"William Knight\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":933693,\"name\":\"Stan Jones\",\"character\":\"Wilson Brown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ktmmN6hnpNHqsliWGTtxmT9czg2.jpg\"},{\"id\":571663,\"name\":\"Marc Hamilton\",\"character\":\"John Wollam\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":933694,\"name\":\"John Wiley\",\"character\":\"John M. Scott\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":14253,\"name\":\"Slim Pickens\",\"character\":\"Pete Bracken\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8UwvsZe0frSzCoyC8KGSfjAaZBf.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9477,\"title\":\"King Arthur\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKLZEAnjzr51Ij7TJtNejc5CN3i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pzxTnjc3IyVEjISyu3WyyHM0QI6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of the Arthurian legend, based on the 'Sarmatian hypothesis' which contends that the legend has a historical nucleus in the Sarmatian heavy cavalry troops stationed in Britain, and that the Roman-British military commander, Lucius Artorius Castus is the historical person behind the legend.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11658,\"title\":\"Tae Guk Gi: The Brotherhood of War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efc2MwDwvQsYsbxLXaXtlmOJ7LZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqaKsofz49zjNhi48sxQIq8U73X.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When two brothers are forced to fight in the Korean War, the elder decides to take the riskiest missions if it will help shield the younger from battle.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22972,\"title\":\"Green Zone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/czFIaeukSxNEccysQeys1PCkuOG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3EE9h3xYxIastf5xVLbezH3eGps.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the U.S.-led occupation of Baghdad in 2003, Chief Warrant Officer Roy Miller and his team of Army inspectors are dispatched to find weapons of mass destruction believed to be stockpiled in the Iraqi desert. Rocketing from one booby-trapped and treacherous site to the next, the men search for deadly chemical agents but stumble instead upon an elaborate cover-up that threatens to invert the purpose of their mission.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":927342,\"title\":\"Amaran\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kcspKUpofalIuPgAndZOMJz0hwg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7cNE2qydew1c8fqnlhWjkE3DHc2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A heroic true story of Major Mukund Varadarajan, an Indian Army officer who displayed extraordinary bravery during a counterterrorism mission in Kashmir’s Shopian district. The film captures his courage in protecting his nation and the devotion of his wife Indhu Rebecaa Varghese.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76349,\"title\":\"1911\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k93DWz849jCsHW7rIbeUAIxewpr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/io6lNWxoQB9YEjwhcT4CGDjyqhr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"China's first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4435,\"title\":\"Aśoka\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ckFDMqLjhsYo2kH3X5auV1NnjPM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyGiG4wcr0BHpqIXiep5MRCQ7Kz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young Prince Asoka works to perfect his skills in battle and also deals with family conflict. During a struggle with one of his step-brothers, his mother urges Asoka to escape to stay alive. While away, Asoka meets Kaurwaki and falls in love, but must use his skills as a warrior to protect her. A dangerous and heartbreaking web of conspiracy follows, which leads Asoka to embrace a Buddhist path.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9093,\"title\":\"The Four Feathers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bfmpeRr9LTXzBC2dpC89FE5uavK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2IojDzEWedVbre8KZhZPMoP5az4.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young British officer resigns his post when he learns of his regiment's plan to ship out to the Sudan for the conflict with the Mahdi. His friends and fiancée send him four white feathers as symbols of what they view as his cowardice. To redeem his honor, he disguises himself as an Arab and secretly saves their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8349,\"title\":\"The Red Baron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lUuryram6Aoa11dCgoXohR8avjU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A20D83vGtFGF47rYF4TjHEw06Dm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Richthofen goes off to war like thousands of other men. As fighter pilots, they become cult heroes for the soldiers on the battlefields. Marked by sportsmanlike conduct, technical exactitude and knightly propriety, they have their own code of honour. Before long he begins to understand that his hero status is deceptive. His love for Kate, a nurse, opens his eyes to the brutality of war.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":89584,\"title\":\"Conquest 1453\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xzTAM0yaOKkdD4C2tVbdHilcNAc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eEtBGMENh3UBax2wz0ZvBzCzxPu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the death of his father Murat II, young Mehmet II ascends to the Ottoman throne. After braving internal and external enemies, he decides to complete what he was destined to do: Conquer Constantinople.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14111,\"title\":\"Battle for Haditha\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jHyRWich4t0CQtgHiN7nnrbcEVv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m0edcSYyX4A4EgzsI9wtXIPsV6.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An investigation of the massacre of 24 men, women and children in Haditha, Iraq allegedly shot by 4 U.S. Marines in retaliation for the death of a U.S. Marine killed by a roadside bomb. The movie follows the story of the Marines of Kilo Company, an Iraqi family, and the insurgents who plant the roadside bomb.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663870,\"title\":\"Riders of Justice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sshNnwmQLk720iBQ0dZg3GVGKfK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7XZsVVnqTsMJXg3J4CHzeV2Lro9.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Markus returns home to care for his daughter when his wife dies in a tragic train accident. However, when a survivor of the wreck surfaces and claims foul play, Markus suspects his wife was murdered and embarks on a mission to find those responsible.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ue9-eZf7rZA\",\"name\":\"The Great Locomotive Chase (1984) Promo - Disney Channel\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}